WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:11.060
My main antenna got stuck and never opened, so I had to send everything home through a tiny backup antenna.

2
00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:17.900
I still sent a probe into Jupiter and found hints of a salty ocean under Europa's ice.

3
00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:24.950
To keep Earth germs away from that ocean, my team steered me into Jupiter at the end.

4
00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:29.450
I fell into Jupiter so Europa would stay clean.
